//RS //! c46 drift-guard: TextMate grammar keyword patterns must track Syntax::JET_KEYWORD_LIST.
//RS //!
//RS //! Reads `Tools/editors/vscode/syntaxes/jet.tmLanguage.json`, extracts every word
//RS //! from the keyword `"match"` regex alternation groups, and asserts:
//RS //!   1. Every word in `Syntax::JET_KEYWORD_LIST` is covered (no silent omissions).
//RS //!   2. No `FOREIGN_*` word from `crates/jet-foundation/src/Syntax.rs` appears in a keyword pattern
//RS //!      (those are teaching-error-only words that must not get syntax highlighting).
//RS //!
//RS //! The test does NOT rewrite the grammar — it is a tripwire so that a keyword
//RS //! addition that wasn't mirrored in the grammar fails loudly.
//RS 
